        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoluni Daudi Sikilag, kiyakiya ŋiboro ŋulu aŋatuni iŋes ŋice neni a ŋikasikou a Yudaya a ŋulu arae ŋikonei keŋ, tema, “Erae lu ainakinet neni kus aloboro a ŋulu aŋatuni ayoŋ alomoe a Ekapolon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
